[h1]Smart District Planner[/h1]
Pick a city and the districts you want. The planner searches the city's three rings for the layout with the highest adjacency bonus and turns it into map tacks with district icons in one click. It can also choose sites for new cities and plan several cities together.

Placement rules and adjacency come from [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2428969051]Detailed Map Tacks[/url] (DMT), so a plan shows the same numbers you later see on the tacks.

[b]Requires Detailed Map Tacks.[/b] Subscribe to it as well.

[h2]Tabs[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]One city[/b]: mark each district Must, Pool or Off, set how many districts to plan and how much each yield counts. You get three plans with different district mixes; click one to preview it on the map, then place the tacks. Wonders can be planned together with the districts.
[*][b]City sites[/b]: choose spots for new cities on the explored map, weighing fresh water, workable tiles, Luxury and Strategic resources, district potential and how much the new cities overlap. Three plans, previewed on the map, then marked with City Center tacks.
[*][b]Several cities[/b]: plan districts and wonders for site tacks and nearby cities together, counting adjacency across cities and empire-wide limits. Each city can have its own district list, or a template built from your civilization's adjacency rules.
[/list]

[h2]In every tab[/h2]
[list]
[*]Three effort levels: Fast, Standard and Thorough. Small cases are solved exhaustively; otherwise the result says how far it may be from the best, and you can keep optimizing.
[*]Same position, same settings, same result every time.
[*]Built districts and your own tacks are never moved or covered; they count as neighbors.
[*]Neighborhoods get Housing from Appeal. Preserves count their Housing and, when set to Must, the yields their Groves and Sanctuaries give adjacent tiles. An Aqueduct is added when the city lacks fresh water, a Dam when there are enough Floodplains tiles.
[*]When a plan relies on nearby Woods or Rainforest, a reminder tack on those tiles says what chopping them would cost.
[*]Long searches run over several frames, so the game stays responsive, and they finish even if you close the panel. Placed tacks can be undone, also after loading a save.
[*]Open the panel with the hexagon button at the top left of the screen or with Shift+L.
[*]Base game, Rise and Fall, and Gathering Storm. English and Simplified Chinese, following the game language.
[/list]

[h2]Notes[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]One planner per game.[/b] Do not enable Auto Map Tacks Planner, Empire Planner or other district planners at the same time: they replace the same map tack functions and interfere with each other.
[*]Safe for saves: the tacks are ordinary map tacks, and saves still load after the mod is disabled.
[*]Multiplayer has not been tested.
[/list]

Comparison with Auto Map Tacks Planner and Empire Planner on the same positions, speed and known limitations: [url=https://smallspider0.github.io/civ6-smart-district-planner/en/]overview and evaluation[/url].
Source code, bug reports and change log: [url=https://github.com/SmallSpider0/civ6-smart-district-planner]GitHub[/url].

[hr][/hr]

[h1]智能区域规划器[/h1]
选一座城和想建的区域，它在城市三环内找相邻加成最高的摆法，一键打成带区域图标的地图钉；也能给新城选址，让几座城一起规划。合法性和加成由 Detailed Map Tacks（DMT）计算，与地图钉上显示的数一致。

[b]需要先订阅 Detailed Map Tacks。[/b]

[h2]三个页签[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]单城[/b]：把区域设为必建、候选或不建，给出区域数量和产出权重，得到三套区域组合不同的方案；点一套就在地图上预览，确认后打钉。可以一起放奇观。
[*][b]选城址[/b]：在已探索的地图上给几座新城选位置，考虑水源、耕作地块、奢侈与战略资源、区域潜力和新城之间不抢地。三套方案，预览后打城址钉。
[*][b]多城[/b]：城址钉和附近的现有城市一起规划区域和奇观，跨城的相邻加成和帝国上限都计入。每座城可以有自己的区域清单，或套用按本文明相邻规则生成的模板。
[/list]

[h2]各页签共用[/h2]
[list]
[*]快速、标准、精细三档。规模小时穷举；否则注明离最优可能差多少，可以继续优化。
[*]同一局面、同样设置，结果每次相同。
[*]已建区域和你自己打的钉不挪、不压，并作为邻居计分。
[*]社区按魅力计住房；保护区计住房，设为必建时再计古树林、避难所给周边地块的产出。缺淡水时自动加水渠，泛滥平原够多时自动加水坝。
[*]方案靠旁边的树林、雨林拿加成时，在这些格上打提醒钉，写明砍掉会少什么。
[*]耗时长的计算分帧进行，游戏不卡，关掉面板也会算完。打出的钉可以撤销，读档后也能撤销。
[*]从启动栏的六边形按钮或 Shift+L 打开面板。
[*]原版、迭起兴衰、风云变幻都能用；界面中英双语，跟随游戏语言。
[/list]

[h2]注意[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]一局只开一个规划器[/b]：不要和 Auto Map Tacks Planner、Empire Planner 等区域规划模组同时启用，它们改的是同一组地图钉函数，会互相干扰。
[*]不影响存档：打出的钉就是普通地图钉，停用本模组后存档照常能读。
[*]多人游戏没有测试过。
[/list]

和 Auto Map Tacks Planner、Empire Planner 在同样局面下的对比、速度和已知限制见[url=https://smallspider0.github.io/civ6-smart-district-planner/]介绍与评测[/url]；源代码、问题反馈和更新记录在 [url=https://github.com/SmallSpider0/civ6-smart-district-planner]GitHub[/url]。
